title: Payers › History & Changes › Earlier process view
route: /payers/summit?tab=history
intro: The Workflow Builder replaced the Process tab, and nothing the Process tab showed is lost: each payer's earlier steps and conditions were migrated into a published graph named '<payer> process (migrated)'. The 'Earlier process view (migrated)' section keeps the original, read only, as it was saved: numbered steps with their step type, agents and typical time, and each condition drawn next to the step it leads to. It is the record the migration was made from. A suggestion that Historian proposed and a person accepted lands here and in a draft of the migrated workflow.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Open History & Changes\nclick 'Earlier process view (migrated)' (closed)"
screen sm "Closed: 'Version 7, edited 10/12. Read only; the Workflow Builder\nholds the same process.'"
screen top "Open: a grey line\n'Read only. How an authorization works with Summit, version 7, edited 10/12.'\nand an info icon ('About the earlier process view') with the step-type key"
screen st "Numbered steps\n1 Check coverage, 2 Gather the documents, 3 Give notice,\n4 Send the request, 5 Follow up, 6 Decision and next review\nEach: step-type chip (Checklist, File, Portal or Phone step),\nagent chips, one sentence, 'Typical' time on the right"
screen br "Conditions under a step\n'If program is Residential 3.5' → File step\n'Nine documents, including the ASAM assessment and a withdrawal scale'"
process ro "No Edit button: to change the process, edit the migrated workflow in the Workflow Builder"
process mg "The graph in the Workflow Builder was made from this record\nEvery step and condition is kept, in the same order\nIt applies to any request type and every service\nuntil a more specific workflow is published"
click ib "Click the info icon, press Escape"
toast tp "'The steps the agents followed before the Workflow Builder, kept as saved.\nThe builder has the same process as a graph; change it there.'"
decision ca "Was a Historian suggestion accepted?"
process v8 "Version goes up by one and the new branch shows here"
goto g1 "Continues in: Payers › Workflow Builder › Read a workflow"
goto g2 "Continues in: Payers › History & Changes › Suggestions from Historian"
end e1 "Nothing the Process tab showed is lost"

s1 --> sm --> top --> st --> br --> ro
top --> ib --> tp
ro --> mg --> g1
br --> ca
ca -->|Yes| v8 --> g2
ca -->|No| e1
mg --> e1
